---
/**
 * A numbered walkthrough. Wraps <Step> children and numbers them with a CSS
 * counter, so inserting a step never means renumbering the others by hand.
 *
 * Use it for a procedure the reader follows in order. An ordered Markdown list
 * is the right choice for anything shorter or less sequential — the prose
 * styling in global.css already gives those a display-weight brand numeral.
 */
---

<ol class="not-prose my-9 space-y-6 [counter-reset:step]" data-steps>
  <slot />
</ol>
